  <work>
    <work-title>Altijd is Kortjakje ziek</work-title>
  </work>
  <movement-title>Altijd is Kortjakje ziek — chant et piano</movement-title>
  <identification>
    <creator type="composer">Traditionnel</creator>
    <creator type="arranger">Chansonade — new simple piano accompaniment</creator>
    <rights>Traditional melody and words: public-domain source material. New piano arrangement and MusicXML encoding dedicated to CC0 1.0 by Chansonade. https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/</rights>
    <encoding>
      <encoding-date>2026-11-02</encoding-date>
      <software>Chansonade build-public-songs.py</software>
    </encoding>
    <source>https://www.dbnl.org/tekst/abra007rijm02_01/abra007rijm02_01_0066.php
Traditional Dutch verse from Simon Abramsz., Rijmpjes en versjes uit de oude doos, p. 65 (collection first published 1910; DBNL witness is a later printing). Historical words “boek met zilverwerk” preserved; closing repetition added on the traditional Ah! vous dirai-je, maman melody. No illustrations, page layout or modern piano arrangement reused.</source>
    <miscellaneous>
      <miscellaneous-field name="language">nl</miscellaneous-field>
    </miscellaneous>
  </identification>
